repository: /home/mps2210/surfaceplate-sweep/repos/c5
standard  : 0.17.0 installed 2026-09-09

Advisory (1) - not a failure:
  - the pre-commit hook was declined at install: nothing checks staged changes before they are committed, and this repository relies on history_audit and review. A gate that claims local_hook enforcement anyway is still a finding (SP038).

Adoption completeness findings (15):
  [SP016] The application profile does not satisfy the control contract
